02)--AggregateExec: mode=FinalPartitioned, gby=[g@0 as g], aggr=[min(alias1), count(alias1)]
03)----RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([g@0], 4), input_partitions=4
04)------AggregateExec: mode=Partial, gby=[g@0 as g], aggr=[min(alias1), count(alias1)]
